  "completeness_bounds": {
    "E": "B_E(W)=max(C^2, floor(C^2*((C-2)^2+16)/32)), C=2(W-1)。導出: s型c<=C → R'<=C^2; d型のみ2相異なら (s1-s2)(s1+s2)=(d2-d1)(d2+d1), s奇 → s1+s2<=C(C-2)/2 → 2*sqrt(2R'-C^2)<=C(C-2)/2。",
    "Z": "B_Z(W)=max(2C'^2, floor(C'^4/4+C'^2)), C'=W-1。導出: 2相異な小さいY → (X1-X2)(X1+X2)=Y2^2-Y1^2 <= C'^2, X1+X2<=C'^2 → 2*sqrt(R'-C'^2)<=C'^2。",
    "O": "B_O(W)=floor(C''^4/4+C''^2), C''=2(W-1)。Zと同型（偶Y）。",
